 # Freebuff
 
 **The free coding agent.** No subscription. No configuration. Start in seconds.
 
 An AI coding agent that runs in your terminal — describe what you want, and Freebuff edits your code.
 
 ## Install
 
 ```bash
 npm install -g freebuff
 ```
 
 ## Usage
 
 ```bash
 cd ~/my-project
 freebuff
 ```
 
 ## Why Freebuff?
 
-**Choice of leading models** — The regular CLI picker includes GLM 5.3 Flash, DeepSeek, GPT-5.6 Luna, MiMo 2.6 Flash, MiMo 2.6 Pro, Solar Pro 4, and Muse Spark 1.2, with GLM 5.3 Flash selected by default.
